   props one for one, so hand-written markup reads like the Lit / Vue tag:

     <mono-breadcrumb size="lg" color="success" variant="contained" truncate>
     <nav mono-breadcrumb mono-size="lg" mono-color="success"
          mono-variant="contained" mono-truncate aria-label="Breadcrumb">
       <ol mono-list>
         <li mono-item>
           <a mono-action href="/">
             <span mono-icon>…</span>
             <span mono-content><span mono-title>Home</span></span>
             <span mono-badge="info">3</span>
           </a>
         </li>
         <li mono-separator aria-hidden="true">›</li>
         <li mono-item mono-current aria-current="page">
           <span mono-action><span mono-content><span mono-title>Now</span></span></span>
         </li>
       </ol>
     </nav>

