   the palette and the inks as custom properties over the Basecoat tokens, and
   the ELEMENT reads them back at mount (`_resolveColor`, `_themeColors`) and
   hands Chart.js real values — a canvas cannot resolve `var()`. The two boxes
   this sheet does paint (the message, the loading veil) keep their classes.

