     the resizer writes, so a drag here moves nothing visible YET still records a
     width — and the drawer would snap to it the moment the viewport grew back past
     the breakpoint. Hiding the handle removes the pointer target so no such drag
     can begin (`_onResizeStart` also guards, as belt-and-braces). */
