   inline top/left — so the static placement rules below must not fight it. */
[mono-dropdown][mono-fixed] > [mono-panel] {
  position: fixed;
}
/* =========================================
   Static placement — `[data-side]` / `[data-align]`, verbatim
   -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
   These are what hand-written markup (and SSR, before the element hydrates)
   positions with. The element overrides them with inline top/left once it has
   measured, which is why every rule here uses only the four edges.
   ========================================= */
