   the field's resolvers; the element copies the field's accent onto it as
   `--cal-accent` / `--cal-accent-foreground` (inline) so it follows the `color`
   prop. Every rule is scoped to our `.mono-flatpickr` marker; flatpickr's own
   geometry (day cells, container widths) is kept — only colour, radius,
   typography and the frame are ours.

   basecoat@1.0.2 styles/vega.css .select:not(select) [data-popover] — the frame:
   bg-popover text-popover-foreground ring-1 ring-foreground/10 rounded-md
   shadow-md. EXTENSION: the day / caption / nav values are shadcn's Calendar
   (Basecoat 1.0.2 ships no calendar): day size-8 rounded-md text-sm,
   hover / today / in-range bg-accent text-accent-foreground, selected
