   props one for one, so hand-written markup reads like the Lit / Vue tag:

     <mono-modal size="lg" color="success" model-value title="Settings">
     <div mono-modal mono-size="lg" mono-color="success" mono-open
          role="dialog" aria-modal="true">
       <div mono-overlay></div>
       <div mono-panel-wrap>
         <div mono-panel role="document">
           <div mono-header>
             <div mono-heading>
               <div mono-title>Settings</div>
               <div mono-subtitle>Manage your account</div>
             </div>
             <button mono-close type="button" aria-label="Close">…</button>
           </div>
           <div mono-body>…</div>
           <div mono-footer>…</div>
         </div>
       </div>
     </div>

