                           flex flex-col sm:max-w-md)
     [mono-header]         ≡ .dialog > * > header (flex flex-col gap-2) — DEVIATION:
                           a ROW, because the ✕ lives inside it (see below)
     [mono-heading]      ≡ upstream's header column itself (flex flex-col gap-2)
                           — the ✕'s row-mate; `slot="header"` replaces it
     [mono-title]        ≡ .dialog > * > header > h2 (leading-none font-medium)
     [mono-subtitle]     ≡ .dialog > * > header > p (text-muted-foreground text-sm
                           leading-normal)
     [mono-body]         ≡ .dialog > * > section (flex-1)
     [mono-footer]         ≡ .dialog > * > footer (flex flex-col-reverse gap-2,
                           sm:flex-row sm:justify-end)
     [mono-close]        ≡ .dialog > * > button (opacity-70 hover:opacity-100,
                           svg size-4) — DEVIATION: in flow inside the head
