     [mono-size="xs|sm|lg|xl|xxl"]                 ≡ EXTENSION — upstream has two steps (default / data-size='sm');
                                                     mono derives all six from --mono-control-height-*
     [mono-color="…"]                              ≡ EXTENSION (the ON track in the role's colour)
     [mono-loading]                                ≡ EXTENSION (the thumb pulses while a change is in flight)

   GEOMETRY — one anchor, everything else derived, and it lands exactly on
   Basecoat at md: the THUMB is the checkbox box (--mono-control-height-md × 4/9
   = 16px = upstream's `size-4`), the track is 1.15 × that tall (18.4px =
   `h-[18.4px]`) and 2 × that wide (32px = `w-[32px]`). So a switch, a checkbox
