   `:not([mono-color])` = primary, `:not([mono-variant])` = underline). The
   element writes them on its root — the host in the light build, an inner root
   in the shadow one — plus `mono-disabled`. The old classes
   (`.mono-tabs.md.primary.variant-pill`, `.mono-tabs-tab.on`) are still emitted
   as inert hooks until 2.0 but no rule here reads them.

